  <thing-type id="ge_76591_01_000" listed="false">
    <label>76591/ZWN4015 Enbrighten Z-Wave 800 Series In-Wall Paddle Switch</label>
    <description><![CDATA[
Enbrighten Z-Wave 800 Series In-Wall Paddle Switch<br /> <h1>Overview</h1><p>Brand Name:Enbrighten<br />Model:76591<br />Manufacturer:Jasco Products Company, LLC<br />UPC:030878765916<br />Included Components:1 Pack Z-wave In-Wall Smart Paddle Switch<br />Part Number:76591 </p> <br /> <h2>Inclusion Information</h2><ol><li>Follow the instructions for your Z-Wave certiﬁed controller to add a device the Z-Wave network.</li><li>2. Once the controller is ready to add your device, press the top or bottom of the rocker.</li></ol> <br /> <h2>Exclusion Information</h2><ol><li>Follow the instructions for your Z-Wave certiﬁed controller to remove a device from the Z-Wave network.</li><li>Once the controller is ready to remove your device, press the top or bottom of the rocker.</li></ol> <br /> <h2>Wakeup Information</h2><p>NA</p>
    ]]></description>
